<title>USA: Innovo Group FY 96 Nov 30 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Innovo Group FY 96 Nov 30 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD, Tenn. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	   loss	 $0.23     loss	 $0.36</p>
<p> Net	   loss	 3,100     loss	   951</p>
<p> Revs			 7,400		    5,300</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Innovo Group Inc net income for fiscal year 1995 includes a one-time gain of $1.9 million, or $0.73 per share, from the settlement of litigation.</p>
<p>The company said the period for fiscal year 1995 ended October 31, 1995.</p>
